Inclusion Criteria:

-Older adults with mild to moderate PD.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Acute medical illness requiring hospitalization;
* Under 40 years old;
* Uncontrolled congestive heart failure;
* History of stroke in the past three years;
* Inability to perform study procedures;
