* Acute hemorrage;
* Enrollment in another study protocol;
* Active infection;
* Malignancy;
* Inability to provide written signed consent to participate in the study.

Inclusion Criteria:

* American Society of Anesthesiologist physical status I-III;
* Scheduled for elective minimally invasive esophagectomy
