f. Serum creatinine (Scr) ≤1.5×ULN g. ALT、AST ≤5×ULN h. TBIL≤1.5×ULN i.International normalized ratio (INR) ≤ 1.5×ULN; or activated partial thromboplastin time (APTT)≤ 1.5×ULN;(except for patients on anticoagulant therapy);
